  "goodToKnow": "Erstmalig means first-time or for the first time, a formal and official word: die erstmalige Zulassung (first registration of a vehicle), Das Festival findet erstmalig statt. The adverb erstmals means the same and is more common in news: erstmals seit 1990. In speech, zum ersten Mal is usual. Compare einmalig (unique, one-off): eine einmalige Chance."
